useradd - create an account and a private home directory

SYNOPSIS
    useradd [-g gid] name

DESCRIPTION
    Root sets the account password at the console. The primary group
    uses the assigned UID unless supplied explicitly with -g.

EXAMPLES
    useradd -g 7350 alice

SEE ALSO
    passwd(1), chown(1)
